        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT UPGRADE SHOULD YOU BUY NEXT?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/34397530bd8cf02858ce187a16c9af3e.poster.avif?t=1780953754\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/34397530bd8cf02858ce187a16c9af3e.webm?t=1780953754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/34397530bd8cf02858ce187a16c9af3e.mp4?t=1780953754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pause the timer, compare your options, and commit to one target stat instead of buying randomly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each purchase changes the prices of other upgrades, so your best move is usually to discount your target stat first, then buy it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SHOULD YOU PRESTIGE NOW OR PUSH FOR MORE MONEY?</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/21ff2c0e8b9db2964fbd9efced778298.poster.avif?t=1780953754\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/21ff2c0e8b9db2964fbd9efced778298.webm?t=1780953754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/21ff2c0e8b9db2964fbd9efced778298.mp4?t=1780953754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your earnings stall, prestige to reset your money while keeping your stats so you can buy more upgrades and scale faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are close to victory, keep your money and finish the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HOW SHOULD YOU SPEND YOUR METAPROGRESSION XP?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/17d8ef0cf221a487a23d75375c7a3549.poster.avif?t=1780953754\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/17d8ef0cf221a487a23d75375c7a3549.webm?t=1780953754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/17d8ef0cf221a487a23d75375c7a3549.mp4?t=1780953754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use metaprogression to boost the stat path you want to focus on during runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you specialize, your upgrades become more powerful when that stat appears, but your run is riskier if the randomized shop does not offer the stat you want to buy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want safer runs, spread your metaprogression XP across multiple stats.</p>",
